<section class="section workloads">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="workloads__title" data-reveal>Checkout our reference workloads</h2>
    <p class="workloads__text" data-reveal>
      Because each customer has different needs and goals, we can create Kubernetes workloads,
      customizing pod composition from the available list of Slicce engines. You can either choose
      to create your own workload or to use our professional team to create it for you. Our expert
      services can be harnessed to produce a new communication engine, a new application function,
      use existing communication engines in a new workload or reproduce a reference workload and
      implement it in a new network.
    </p>
    <a href="/use-cases" class="btn btn--primary workloads__btn" data-reveal="scale">Learn more &gt;</a>
  </div>
</section>

